.SH RETURN VALUE
These functions return
.B OK
on success and
.B ERR
on failure.
.PP
In
.IR \%ncurses ","
.B beep
and
.B flash
return
.B OK
if the terminal type supports the corresponding capability:
.B bell
.RB ( bel )
for
.B beep
and
.B \%flash_screen
.RB ( flash )
for
.BR flash "."
Otherwise they return
.BR ERR "."
